tool-case, list-checks, and settings icons.
Their ISC and applicable MIT copyright/license notices are retained in
src/assets/*.svg, the distributed assets/*.svg, and the generated HTML
that embeds these icons.

Runtime dependencies @google/clasp and Vite are installed separately by npm
and retain their own licenses. They are not copied into gas-portal's sources.

Generated favicon images use Libre Baskerville, copyright 2012 The Libre
Baskerville Project Authors (https://github.com/impallari/Libre-Baskerville),
licensed under SIL Open Font License 1.1. The font is a development-only
npm dependency. Its full license is copied to the published favicon site
as FONT-LICENSE.txt. Font binaries are not included in the GAS output.

Generated kana favicons use Shippori Mincho, copyright 2021 The Shippori
Mincho Project Authors (https://github.com/fontdasu/ShipporiMincho), licensed
under SIL Open Font License 1.1. The full license from this development-only
font dependency is published as JAPANESE-FONT-LICENSE.txt. Font binaries
are not included in the GAS output.

The fallback favicon is the unmodified outline of the character 玄 from
Kouzan Brush Font Sousho (衡山毛筆フォント草書), written and created by
Aoyagi Kouzan (青柳衡山), distributed by Musashi System.
Source: https://opentype.jp/kouzansousho.htm
